			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751360201,
					"content": "這是什麼啊？雖然看起來造型和火磷石差不多，但是會發光還不停往外冒火，感覺比玻娜的火磷石厲害多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751360202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751360202,
					"content": "該不會這才是火磷石原本的樣子？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751360203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751360203,
					"content": "好燙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751360204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751360204,
					"content": "#哇…{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}不要看到什麼寶貝就伸手去拿啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751360205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751360205,
					"content": "不知不覺就…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751360206
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751360206,
					"content": "派蒙沒資格說我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751360207
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751360207,
					"content": "呀！呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751360208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751360208,
					"content": "#嗯？{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}對這個有什麼頭緒嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751360209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751360209,
					"content": "#哇，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}好厲害，看這樣子說不定終於到你大顯身手的地方了哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751360210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751360210,
					"content": "#接下來要是再發現什麼燙燙的寶物，就都可以拜託{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751360211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751360211,
					"content": "噫，呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751360212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751360212,
					"content": "喂！呀齁，這裡這裡！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751360213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751360213,
					"content": "哇，那不是玻娜嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751360214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751360214,
					"content": "不過她怎麼會在那裡啊？該不會是直接落到那邊…總之我們先過去和她會合吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
